  "description_text": "Welcome to 752 East 222nd Street in the heart of the Bronx! Discover an incredible opportunity for homeowners and investors alike! This charming Colonial-style home offers a spacious 4-bedroom duplex, 2 full bathrooms, 1 half bathroom, a comfortable living room, dining area, and a finished basement with additional flexible space. The property features two kitchens and is classified in NYC property records as a two-family frame dwelling (B2), offering exciting possibilities for buyers seeking versatility and long-term investment potential. Location is everything! Conveniently situated near the 2-subway line, Bx39 and Bx8 bus routes, and within walking distance of Metro-North, with easy access to shopping, restaurants, hospitals, schools, and everyday essentials. Enjoy the convenience of city living with everything you need close to home. Whether you're searching for your next home or exploring an investment opportunity, this property is a must-see! Schedule your private showing today!",
