  "description_text": "Cozy City Island home with 3 bedrooms, 2.5 baths. This semi-attached walk up home has all the charm you'd expect from City Island living, with water views from both the front porch and rear private deck. Located on a quiet and family centric street, this home has a 1 car private driveway leading to a small, built-in garage. Stone steps invite you up to a modest porch, perfect for viewing the Island's incredible sunsets. Inside the home, you emerge into the entryway, with living room adjacent. Through this living space is the dining area, with eat-in kitchen. Utilities in this space include refrigerator, dishwasher, stove and washer/dryer in closet. A half-bath is accessible in the hallway. From the dining/kitchen space you can also access the raised rear porch, boasting it's own views of the water. Steps down from this porch take you to the cozy and private rear yard. Back in the home, staircase access from near the front door brings you up to the third floor, containing a full bathroom and three bedrooms. Hallway closet and unfinished attic provide storage space. Back down stairs, the fully finished first floor of the home features additional living, storage or recreational space, with utility room containing hot water heater and furnace, and an additional full bathroom. Back yard access is also available here through a rear entry/exit, with a small stone patio for private relaxation. Street contains a beautiful private beach accessible to purchasers via a $100/year per house fee. Orchard Beach is located nearby. Located on a tight-knit, quiet street just steps away from the P.S. 175 Kindergarten through 8th grade public school. Access to the Bx29 city bus and BxM8 express bus on street corner. Quaint local shopping, popular restaurants and private marinas easily accessible on the island. Please contact the listing broker directly for more information and to schedule showings. (Listing description provided by property owner) *THIS HOME WILL NEVER BE LISTED ON FACEBOOK OR ANY SOCIAL MEDIA*",
